1
00:00:00,520 --> 00:00:02,280
=You Alone Know Me=

2
00:00:02,280 --> 00:00:03,892
(From the Qimao novel "My Bestie's Icy
Dad Got Drunk and Wild After We Wed")

3
00:00:03,892 --> 00:00:04,920
(Written by Qiaoqiaojiang)

4
00:00:05,120 --> 00:00:08,040
=Episode 16=

5
00:00:10,679 --> 00:00:11,720
So while you were

6
00:00:12,320 --> 00:00:14,199
buried in your books,

7
00:00:14,560 --> 00:00:16,039
studying for college entrance exams,

8
00:00:17,039 --> 00:00:19,280
you were already thinking about
your future wife in primary school?

9
00:00:23,600 --> 00:00:24,760
When I got back from Africa,

10
00:00:26,839 --> 00:00:27,480
I found out

11
00:00:29,039 --> 00:00:30,000
something had happened to her family.

12
00:00:30,760 --> 00:00:31,600
It took a long search

13
00:00:32,799 --> 00:00:34,200
to find out the Gus had adopted her.

14
00:00:37,759 --> 00:00:40,079
But I had no reason

15
00:00:41,560 --> 00:00:42,640
to disrupt her life.

16
00:00:43,640 --> 00:00:44,479
Until three years ago,

17
00:00:46,759 --> 00:00:47,960
when she became friends with Bao'er.

18
00:00:49,920 --> 00:00:50,359
Jingshu,

19
00:00:52,240 --> 00:00:53,840
I'm so happy

20
00:00:55,359 --> 00:00:57,000
I get to be part of her life again.

21
00:01:00,960 --> 00:01:01,640
All right.

22
00:01:02,479 --> 00:01:03,320
I understand why

23
00:01:04,840 --> 00:01:05,280
you can't let go.

24
00:01:06,799 --> 00:01:07,959
Does she know any of this?

25
00:01:11,680 --> 00:01:12,560
She doesn't need to.

26
00:01:13,959 --> 00:01:14,840
It's enough that I love her.

27
00:01:18,599 --> 00:01:19,280
Be good to her.

28
00:01:21,439 --> 00:01:22,079
I'd better go.

29
00:01:29,240 --> 00:01:32,640
(Maple Leaf Lake Rose Garden)

30
00:01:36,959 --> 00:01:38,079
(Last time I came,)

31
00:01:38,640 --> 00:01:40,239
(I didn't really take in the scenery.)

32
00:01:41,359 --> 00:01:42,159
(For some reason,)

33
00:01:42,799 --> 00:01:44,280
(I just really wanted to come today.)

34
00:02:06,560 --> 00:02:07,239
Xie Zhouhan?

35
00:02:14,639 --> 00:02:15,319
What are you doing here?

36
00:02:17,039 --> 00:02:18,080
What are you doing here?

37
00:02:22,919 --> 00:02:23,560
I couldn't sleep.

38
00:02:24,039 --> 00:02:24,840
I went for a walk

39
00:02:25,680 --> 00:02:27,280
and somehow ended up here.

40
00:02:29,520 --> 00:02:31,240
Funny. Me too.

41
00:02:36,319 --> 00:02:37,960
Did the Gus treat you badly?

42
00:02:39,000 --> 00:02:39,560
No.

43
00:02:40,439 --> 00:02:42,199
They've both been so good to me.

44
00:02:47,319 --> 00:02:47,800
Want a drink?

45
00:02:50,840 --> 00:02:52,520
You eat junk food, too?

46
00:02:52,840 --> 00:02:53,719
I'm human, too.

47
00:02:59,680 --> 00:03:01,719
I thought big-shot CEOs like you

48
00:03:02,400 --> 00:03:03,919
only ate Western food

49
00:03:04,080 --> 00:03:06,000
or meals made by fancy chefs.

50
00:03:09,240 --> 00:03:10,199
When it comes to food,

51
00:03:10,759 --> 00:03:11,919
CEOs are just like everyone else.

52
00:03:13,400 --> 00:03:14,439
We like to indulge sometimes.

53
00:03:28,800 --> 00:03:31,680
Why'd you bring barbecue and beer?

54
00:03:32,639 --> 00:03:34,360
What if I hadn't shown up?

55
00:03:35,400 --> 00:03:36,439
Were you going to drink alone?

56
00:03:39,879 --> 00:03:41,479
I was thinking about the past today.

57
00:03:43,800 --> 00:03:44,280
(Look.)

58
00:03:44,479 --> 00:03:45,639
(When Mom and Dad have time,)

59
00:03:45,800 --> 00:03:47,719
(we'll take you both to Maple Leaf Lake
to see fireworks.)

60
00:03:47,719 --> 00:03:48,280
(Zhouhan,)

61
00:03:48,520 --> 00:03:49,800
(look over there. Isn't it nice?)

62
00:03:55,080 --> 00:03:55,719
Fireworks!

63
00:03:59,680 --> 00:04:00,840
They're beautiful.

64
00:04:08,400 --> 00:04:10,000
My parents said

65
00:04:10,360 --> 00:04:13,000
they'd take me to Maple Leaf Lake
for the nighttime view

66
00:04:13,080 --> 00:04:13,639
and fireworks.

67
00:04:14,199 --> 00:04:16,399
I thought they were just saying it.

68
00:04:16,839 --> 00:04:18,120
I never thought I'd actually see it.

69
00:04:21,720 --> 00:04:22,519
It's something

70
00:04:23,800 --> 00:04:25,279
I've secretly wanted for years.

71
00:04:27,800 --> 00:04:29,959
(Beneath that cool exterior,)

72
00:04:30,839 --> 00:04:32,279
(he's just an ordinary guy,)

73
00:04:32,759 --> 00:04:33,480
(with his own)

74
00:04:34,000 --> 00:04:35,319
(simple little dreams.)

75
00:04:36,319 --> 00:04:37,240
Why are you looking at me like that?

76
00:04:39,839 --> 00:04:40,519
Nothing.

77
00:04:41,839 --> 00:04:43,040
I was wondering

78
00:04:44,920 --> 00:04:46,399
if this makes me

79
00:04:48,279 --> 00:04:51,720
a Cinderella who met Prince Charming.

80
00:04:54,240 --> 00:04:54,920
No.

81
00:04:56,560 --> 00:04:59,079
It should be the Frog Prince

82
00:05:00,120 --> 00:05:01,360
meeting his Snow White.

83
00:05:01,761 --> 00:05:05,347
♪You are written in the stars♪

84
00:05:05,371 --> 00:05:08,889
♪You are the light inside my scars♪

85
00:05:08,915 --> 00:05:10,048
♪Every breath♪

86
00:05:10,073 --> 00:05:11,549
♪Every heartbeat♪

87
00:05:11,573 --> 00:05:16,346
♪Has been waiting where you are♪

88
00:05:16,370 --> 00:05:19,999
♪You are written in my soul♪

89
00:05:20,024 --> 00:05:24,096
♪You are the place I call my home♪

90
00:05:24,121 --> 00:05:25,092
♪If I fall♪

91
00:05:25,121 --> 00:05:27,501
♪If I break apart♪

92
00:05:27,526 --> 00:05:31,056
♪Let me fall into your arms♪

93
00:05:33,609 --> 00:05:36,920
♪Even if the sky is falling♪

94
00:05:37,303 --> 00:05:40,700
♪Even if doom comes♪

95
00:05:40,781 --> 00:05:43,080
♪I will keep your name♪

96
00:05:43,080 --> 00:05:44,785
♪Inside me♪
(Signature page, Party A Xie Zhouhan)

97
00:05:44,786 --> 00:05:48,305
♪Like the only light I trust♪

98
00:05:48,306 --> 00:05:50,120
♪When the whole world♪

99
00:05:50,120 --> 00:05:52,096
♪Fades to silence♪

100
00:05:52,199 --> 00:05:55,596
♪When forever feels too far♪

101
00:05:55,963 --> 00:05:59,846
♪I will still believe this love♪

102
00:05:59,847 --> 00:06:05,296
♪Was written in the stars♪

103
